WEBVTT

00:03:28.364 --> 00:03:30.485
and the battery supplies the power

00:03:30.485 --> 00:03:33.540
to the small indicator box. I call it a transformer.

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:38.261
And the indicator box makes the lights flash.

00:03:38.261 --> 00:03:42.012
As you can see, the bulbs face outside,

00:03:42.012 --> 00:03:44.500
because that's where the lions come from.

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:48.564
And that's how it looks to lions when they come at night.

00:03:48.564 --> 00:03:51.292
The lights flash and trick

00:03:51.292 --> 00:03:53.234
the lions into thinking I was walking around the cowshed,

00:03:53.234 --> 00:03:55.160
but I was sleeping in my bed.

00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:57.900
(Laughter)

00:03:57.900 --> 00:03:59.569
(Applause)

00:03:59.569 --> 00:04:05.164
Thanks.